      "dct:alternative": "PHARM",
      "dct:bibliographicCitation": "Childhood Cancer Data Initiative (CCDI) National Childhood Cancer Registry (NCCR) Data Platform: An interactive data platform for NCCR cancer statistics [Internet]. National Cancer Institute; [updated: June 21, 2026; cited: June 26, 2026]. doi: 10.71925/byd9-3d93.",
      "dct:description": "Information derived from outpatient pharmacy providers' claims for medications dispensed to patients with cancer. Includes patients with claims since 2000 from commercial plans, Medicaid, and commercial pharmacies. Contains 9- and 11-digit NDC codes, CanMED and RxNorm drug classification, dispense quantity and duration, and months from diagnosis to dispense. Primarily oral antineoplastics and infusion-based chemotherapies; hospital-based chemotherapy agents currently not included. Contains 12,611,171 records.",
